 Keys

 ↑/k  up           tab       next pane             ?   help
 ↓/j  down         shift+tab previous pane         esc back
 pgup page up      1-3       jump to pane          q   quit
 pgdn page down    /         filter
 g    top          o         sort by name
 G    bottom       enter     open
                   r         retry failed lanes











